# Write Artifacts to Disk

ALL outputs must be written to the project tree — never left only in conversation.

| Artifact | Location |
|:---|:---|
| Backtest results | `results/backtest_summary.csv` |
| Per-signal equity curves | `results/equity_{ID}.csv` |
| Rolling Sharpe | `results/rolling_sharpe.csv` |
| HTML report | `results/report.html` |
| Charts | `results/charts/` |
| Execution plans | `docs/plans/active/` |
| Completed plans | `docs/plans/completed/` |
| Experiment log | `results.tsv` (untracked by git) |

The autoresearch loop uses `results.tsv` to track which experiments were kept/discarded.
